<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Lord's My Shepherd (Scottish Psalter)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1650</span><span class="sg-chain-h">metrical translation, sung to Crimond</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The King of Love My Shepherd Is (Henry Baker)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1868</span><span class="sg-chain-h">hymn paraphrase</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Bay Psalm Book</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1640</span><span class="sg-chain-h">metrical paraphrase</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Sidney Psalms (Philip Sidney)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">metrical paraphrase</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Geneva Bible</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1557</span><span class="sg-chain-h">translation</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">King James Bible</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1611</span><span class="sg-chain-h">translation</span></li></ul></section>
